      "4. Service plans and offers are subjected to terms and conditions of the Merchant.",
      "5. Cardholders are required to settle payment of Eligible Cards during the Promotion Period to enjoy the Offer. For the avoidance of doubt, the Offers are not applicable to the following types of transactions: any transactions that are subject to cancellation, charge-back, return of goods and/or refund; any autopay, unposted transactions or any other payment transactions as specified by Citibank from time to time,; reloads of e-Wallet or Octopus Automatic Add-Value Service; or any other type of transaction as determined by Citibank from time to time. 6. Cardholders are required to state their intention to enjoy the Offer before ordering and settle the payment by Eligible Cards to enjoy the Offer.",
      "7. Unless otherwise specified, the Offer cannot be used in conjunction with other special promotions, discounts, or promotional coupons, nor be transferred or exchanged for cash or other offers.",
      "8. Availability of the Offer is subject to offer or service availability, account status checking and final acceptance by Citibank and the Merchant’s absolute discretion. Photos, product specifications and prices are for reference only.",
      "9. Citibank shall not be responsible for any matters in relation to the related products or services provided by the Merchant. The Merchant is solely responsible for all obligations and liabilities relating to such products or services and all auxiliary services.",
      "10. Citibank and the Merchant reserve the right to amend the terms and conditions without prior notice.",
      "11. All matters and disputes are subject to the final decision of Citibank and the Merchant.",
      "12. In the event of any discrepancy between the English and Chinese versions of these terms and conditions, the English version shall prevail.",
      "13. Other terms and conditions apply, please inquire about the details with the Merchant.",
      "14. The referenced document provides information about, and access to accounts and financial services provided by Citibank (Hong Kong) Limited and Citibank, N.A. Hong Kong Branch in Hong Kong. It does not, and should not be construed as, an offer, invitation or solicitation of services to individuals residing outside of Hong Kong. This reference document is not intended for distribution to, or use by, any person in any country where such distribution or use would be contrary to local law or regulation, and none of the services or investments referred to in this referenced document are available to persons resident in any country where the provision of such services or investments would be contrary to local law or regulation. \"Citi Credit Cards: HKT Service Plan Subscription Offer (including csl / Netvigator / Now TV) ” Terms and Conditions:",
      "15. During the Promotion Period, Cardholders are required to newly subscribe HKT service plan (including csl, Netvigator or Now TV) and settling the payment with Eligible Cards to enjoy the following offers. (“Offers”) NETVIGATOR Offer: Subscribe a 36-month NETVIGATOR 1000M broadband service to enjoy free upgrade to 2x1000M broadband (“Offer 1”) Terms and Conditions:",
      "16. Cardholders who subscribe NETVIGATOR 1000M broadband service can enjoy free upgrade to 2x1000M broadband service. The offer is available only to new customers of NETVIGATOR (whose service installation address has not been installed with any NETVIGATOR broadband service for the past three (3) months prior to the application date) residing on designated estates. This offer is available to cardholders who agree to a designated 36-month commitment period. Terms and conditions apply, for details, please contact staff for all plans and offers. csl Designated Service Plan Offer: Subscribe a 24/36-month designated csl 5G service plan to enjoy free 20GB Asia Pacific Data (“Offer 2”) Terms and Conditions:",
      "17. Cardholders who subscribe a designated csl 5G service plan and agree to a commitment period of 24 months or 36 months qualify for 20 extra Asia Pacific Data Roaming Passes (valid for 12 months) during the contract period. An administration fee of HK$18 per month applies to all service plans. Cardholders must be a new customer or a number port-in of csl. Terms & Conditions apply. For Asia Pacific Data Roaming Passes details, please contact staff or refer to website https://www.hkcsl.com/en/data-roaming-pass/. For details, please contact staff for all plans and offers. Now TV Add-On Offer: Subscribe to Offer 1 or Offer 2 to enjoy monthly fees as low as HK$38 for a designated NowTV sports/entertainment combo (available as an add-on to Offer 1 or Offer 2) (“Offer 3”) Terms and Conditions:",
      "18. Subscribe to Offer 1 or Offer 2 to enjoy monthly fees as low as HK$38 for a designated Now TV sports/entertainment combo (“available as an add-on to Offer 1 or Offer 2”). The offer is only available under monthly Now TV service plans with designated commitment period. The subscription fees shown here do not include the SD/HD/4K connection fee and rental fee of a Now TV Set-Top Box. In order to rent a Now TV Set-Top Box (with SD/HD/4K Connection) (“Set-Top Box,”) you are required to subscribe to a Now TV service plan with a 24/36 months commitment period and a monthly fee of HK$38 and a one-off installation fee of HKD$980 (if applicable). All the prices stated are in Hong Kong dollars. For certain additional features that a Set-Top Box offers, please refer to “Now TV Contract/Application Form” section on Now TV Website (https://www.nowtv.now.com/terms-and-conditions/). HD and 4K services are available only to Now TV HD customers subscribing to designated channels/pack and paying the monthly Set-Top box rental service (with SD/HD/4K Connection). HD and 4K services are subject to relevant Terms and conditions. Please refer to nowtv.now.com/terms-and-conditions or contact us for the latest information. Please note that Now TV Limited cannot guarantee the continued availability of the channels, programs and services on the Now TV service for the entire duration of your Now TV subscription; and it shall not be liable for any unavailability or delay in the broadcast, of any matches and/or programming. The channel line-up and programming on the Now TV services; and hours of broadcast of any program or channel are subject to change from time to time. The number of channels is subject to change to be announced by Now TV from time to time. Now TV services and Content will be provided to you and can only be accessed through a compatible television connected to a Now TV Set-Top Box (charges applicable,) through internet streaming via the Now Apps (e.g. the Now TV App) on compatible mobile devices and/or specific smart televisions, and/or Now TV Website on specific computer operating systems, browsers and applications. You need to register a Now ID for accessing the Now TV service, Now ID can be either your email address or mobile number. For details, please contact staff for all plans and offers.",
      "19. NETVIGATOR service is provided by HKT Opco and applicable to Offer 1, csl service is provided by CSL and applicable to Offer 2, Now TV service is provided by Now TV Limited and it is available as an add-on to Offer 1 or Offer 2.",
      "20. Offer is only applicable to Designated Sales Channels (such as retail shops, hotline and/or direct sales) by the relevant Merchant, excluding online sales channel (such as csl eShop or e-commerce platforms) (“Designated Sales Channels”).",
      "21. The Offer is also subject to the availability of the Designated Plans which are subject to change and may be updated by the relevant Merchant(s) from time to time without prior notice. Please enquire with the relevant Merchant for details.",
      "22. Service plans and offers of the Designated Services are subjected to terms and conditions of the relevant Merchant. For customers of csl services, the General Terms and Conditions of CSL apply (https://www.hkcsl.com/en/service-terms-and-conditions/). For NETVIGATOR services only cover designated areas and subject to relevant terms and conditions; for details, please see NETVIGATOR’s website at www.netvigator.com. For Now TV services only cover designated areas and subject to relevant terms and conditions; for details, please see Now TV’s website at https://nowtv.hk."
